      "startLine": 9,
      "text": "Button Action & Trait Templates",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "endLine": 11,
      "startLine": 11,
      "text": "These are mini templates utilized by the DnD Character Sheet Template to easily add multiple traits/actions with formatting already in place.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "endLine": 13,
      "startLine": 13,
      "text": "These use the buttons plugin to insert the template using ^button-name on other templates. I usually have 1 note with a whole list of button codeblock to point to for my other templates that use buttons.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "endLine": 15,
      "startLine": 15,
      "text": "",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "depth": 6,
      "endLine": 17,
      "startLine": 17,
      "text": "Trait",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "endLine": 25,
      "startLine": 18,
      "text": "```button\nname Add Trait\ntype prepend template\naction Path/To/Trait Template\n```\n^button-trait",
      "type": "code"
    },
    {
      "endLine": 32,
      "startLine": 27,
      "text": "###### Trait\n**Description of trait**\n\n- Bullet list of what traits do",
